0..71 Comment "// Bounded naturals as they should read, and what refuses each program."
72..74 Comment "//"
75..153 Comment "// `Fin(n)` holds the naturals below `n`. A case on one binds each arm\'s index"
154..233 Comment "// equation and prunes an arm only where its ends are apart. It neither refines"
234..283 Comment "// by the equation nor prunes a match of no arms."
284..286 Comment "//"
287..358 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
359..437 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
438..459 Comment "// to the model root."
460..462 Comment "//"
463..541 Comment "// - see: #3484 — not implemented: the empty match at an indexed family, for"
542..558 Comment "//   `absurdFin`"
559..632 Comment "// - see: #3483 — not implemented: refinement by solution, for `lookup`"
633..695 Comment "// - see: #3515 — not implemented: injectivity, for `lookup`"
696..751 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
753..789 Comment "// The naturals the bounds count in."
